url: >-
  https://resources.wolframcloud.com/PacletRepository/resources/Taggar/SimplicialHomology/
abstract: >-
  Computations in simplicial homology are crucial for
  algebraic topology and computational geometry in general.
  Though Several mature software systems provide facilities
  for working with simplicial complexes, there is currently
  limited support for such computations within the Wolfram
  Language ecosystem. This paper presents
  SimplicialHomology, an open-source Wolfram Language paclet
  for abstract constructing simplicial complexes and
  computing their homology groups over the integers,
  rational numbers, and finite fields. Furthermore, the
  package supports many other functionalities such as
  calculating Betti numbers, automorphism groups, and other
  constructions such as joins, stars, links, etc. Several
  examples are presented to illustrate the package and its
  performance.
